r['reviewed_at_utc']='2026-10-20T18:49:46Z'
r['decision']='Accepted within the reviewed source-declaration, cascade, inherited typography and pure popover-positioning scope. R1-R7 resolved. Not real-browser, whole-UI visual or pixel-parity acceptance.'
