(out/'review.json').write_text(json.dumps(r,ensure_ascii=False,indent=2)+'\n')
lines=['# Independent frozen inventory source review: scoped acceptance','',r['decision'],'','## Resolved findings','']
for f in r['findings']: lines += [f"- {f['id']}: {f['area']}. {f['resolution']}"]
lines += ['', '## Inherited typography and narrow geometry', '', '- Main inventory h1 retains 20px/30px/600, and section h3 again inherits the source unitless 1.5 line-height. Frame 13px/1.5 and workbench 12px/1.5 baselines remain explicit. Primary white ink and neutral/link roles are no longer defeated by a higher-specificity native reset.', '- '+r['narrow_geometry_review']['source_equivalence'],'- '+r['narrow_geometry_review']['boundary'],'','## Independent bounded regression','', '- run-cascade-precedence.cjs reads actual tokens/frame/controls/inventory CSS. It checks computed rule selection for primary, neutral, text, link, pager, ghost, stock and h1 roles, with an outside native button control. A negative control restores only the old reset in memory and reproduces the former dark primary/link/text ink.', '- An additional typography oracle expands only the exact declared font-family token because jsdom cannot reliably resolve a custom property inside the font shorthand. It verifies inherited 1.5 control/section-heading line-height. Negative controls restore the former shorthand and 20px heading and reproduce both differences.', '- CSS role strings and declaration precedence are tested, not actual resolved color contrast, widths, clipping, rasterization or browser pixels. Source numeric ink/font-weight and source fold/cell geometry remain represented.', '- All 17 current owned manifest hashes match the latest README/frame/controls/inventory files. Independent regression hashes match the current four tested CSS files. Initial review is preserved in initial-review.md/json. No implementation edit, network, database, install, browser attempt or heavy-suite repetition was performed by this reviewer.','', '## Artifact and claim boundary','', f'- Current full synthetic HTML: {artifact.stat().st_size:,} bytes; SHA256 {sha(artifact)}.', '- Exact Page cap: 262,144 bytes. Excess: 26,466 bytes. Not Page-embeddable. No feature removed for cap. This review did not attach, publish, embed, deliver or execute the HTML in a real browser.', '- Original Empty SVG/MIT verification remains valid. Canonical product/color/FIT/size/SKU identity, known-zero versus absent-spec semantics and documented bounded-native-selector exceptions remain unchanged.', '- No permitted reference/runtime screenshot comparison exists. This is scoped source-level acceptance of the seven corrected findings, not whole-UI visual, host-fit or pixel-parity acceptance.','', 'Full finding, manifest and independent evidence hashes are recorded in review.json.','']
(out/'review.md').write_text('\n'.join(lines))
print(json.dumps({'decision':r['decision'],'manifest_files':len(verified),'manifest_sha256':sha(manifest),'artifact_bytes':artifact.stat().st_size,'artifact_sha256':sha(artifact),'report_sha256':sha(out/'review.md'),'json_sha256':sha(out/'review.json'),'regression_sha256':sha(out/'run-cascade-precedence.cjs')},indent=2))
